            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Whatever feels smooth and controlled, which is often between 2 and 3 mph. This is why speed increments matter: machines that adjust in 0.5 mph steps cannot express the difference between a comfortable pace and one that lengthens your stride into discomfort. Look for 0.1 mph steps and a low minimum speed.",
